<title>ESTONIA: BALTIKA'S JAN-APRIL PROFIT 4.9 MLN EEK - REPORT.</title>
<headline>BALTIKA'S JAN-APRIL PROFIT 4.9 MLN EEK - REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltika, Estonia's largest clothing manufacturer and retailer, had a net profit of 4.9 million kroons in the first four months of this year, Aripaev business paper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The figure is double the results for the same period in 1996, the paper said.</p>
<p>Baltika is seeking a listing on the main list of the Tallinn bourse.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
